#: ui/settings.slint:716
msgctxt "SettingsWindow"
msgid "Cancel (right-click works too)"
msgstr "取消（也可以右键单击）"

#: ui/settings.slint:752
msgctxt "SettingsWindow"
msgid ""
"Everything happens on this computer. QRcode tool sends no usage data and "
"never checks links online. The only network request is the optional update "
"check to GitHub."
msgstr "一切都在这台电脑上完成。QRcode tool 不发送任何使用数据，也从不在线检查链接。唯一的网络请求是可选的 GitHub 更新检查。"

#: ui/settings.slint:761
msgctxt "SettingsWindow"
msgid "Keep a scan history"
msgstr "保留扫描历史记录"

#: ui/settings.slint:762
msgctxt "SettingsWindow"
msgid ""
"Stored only on this computer. Wi-Fi passwords and 2-step verification keys "
"are never saved."
msgstr "仅保存在这台电脑上。Wi-Fi 密码和两步验证密钥永远不会被保存。"

